{"questions":[{"question_id":"mnswhr0d","content":"<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.452ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"42.081ex\" height=\"2.149ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 18600 950\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\"> Match the List-I with List-II </text></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n\n<table class=\"tg\"><thead>\n\n  <tr>\n\n    <th class=\"tg-c3ow\" colspan=\"2\">List-I<br>Deficiency Disease</th>\n\n    <th class=\"tg-c3ow\" colspan=\"2\">List-I<br>Vitamin</th>\n\n  </tr></thead>\n\n<tbody>\n\n  <tr>\n\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">A.</td>\n\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">Scurvy</td>\n\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">I.</td>\n\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">Pyridoxine</td>\n\n  </tr>\n\n  <tr>\n\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">B.</td>\n\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">Convulsions</td>\n\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">II.</td>\n\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">Vitamin A</td>\n\n  </tr>\n\n  <tr>\n\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">C.</td>\n\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">Cheilosis</td>\n\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">III.</td>\n\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">Ascorbic Acid</td>\n\n  </tr>\n\n  <tr>\n\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">D.</td>\n\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">Xerophthalmia</td>\n\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">IV.</td>\n\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">Riboflavin</td>\n\n  </tr>\n\n</tbody>\n\n</table>\n<p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below :</p>","chapter":"biomolecules","chapterGroup":"organic-chemistry","country":"in","difficulty":"easy","exam":"jee-main","examGroup":"jee","languages":["en","hi"],"marks":4,"negMarks":1,"paperId":"jee-main-2026-online-6th-april-morning-shift","paperTitle":"JEE Main 2026 (Online) 6th April Morning Shift","permalink":"p-text--match-the-list-i-with-list-ii--p-style-jee-main-chemistry-some-basic-concepts-of-chemistry-nu3q32xheree6ykn","question":{"en":{"comprehension":null,"direction":null,"content":"<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.452ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"42.081ex\" height=\"2.149ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 18600 950\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\"> Match the List-I with List-II </text></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n\n<table class=\"tg\"><thead>\n\n  <tr>\n\n    <th class=\"tg-c3ow\" colspan=\"2\">List-I<br>Deficiency Disease</th>\n\n    <th class=\"tg-c3ow\" colspan=\"2\">List-I<br>Vitamin</th>\n\n  </tr></thead>\n\n<tbody>\n\n  <tr>\n\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">A.</td>\n\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">Scurvy</td>\n\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">I.</td>\n\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">Pyridoxine</td>\n\n  </tr>\n\n  <tr>\n\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">B.</td>\n\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">Convulsions</td>\n\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">II.</td>\n\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">Vitamin A</td>\n\n  </tr>\n\n  <tr>\n\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">C.</td>\n\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">Cheilosis</td>\n\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">III.</td>\n\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">Ascorbic Acid</td>\n\n  </tr>\n\n  <tr>\n\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">D.</td>\n\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">Xerophthalmia</td>\n\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">IV.</td>\n\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">Riboflavin</td>\n\n  </tr>\n\n</tbody>\n\n</table>\n<p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below :</p>","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"<p>A-I, B-III, C-II, D-IV</p>\n"},{"identifier":"B","content":"<p>A-I, B-III, C-IV, D-II</p>\n"},{"identifier":"C","content":"<p>A-III, B-I, C-IV, D-II</p>\n"},{"identifier":"D","content":"<p>A-III, B-I, C-II, D-IV</p>"}],"correct_options":["C"],"answer":null,"explanation":"<p>Let us recall the vitamin deficiencies and the corresponding diseases:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><p><strong>Scurvy</strong> – caused due to deficiency of <strong>Vitamin C (Ascorbic acid)</strong>.  </p>\n<p>→ So, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"8.637ex\" height=\"1.645ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -716 3817.6 727\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D434\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D434\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1027.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"2192\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2192\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2305.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D43C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2809.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D43C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(3313.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D43C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43C\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p></li>\n<li><p><strong>Convulsions</strong> – occur due to deficiency of <strong>Vitamin B<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.988ex\" height=\"1.101ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -320.9 436.6 486.5\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(33,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"36\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-36\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></strong> (<strong>Pyridoxine</strong>).  </p>\n<p>→ So, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.377ex\" height=\"1.57ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 2818.6 694\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D435\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D435\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1036.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"2192\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2192\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2314.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D43C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43C\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p></li>\n<li><p><strong>Cheilosis</strong> – characterized by cracks at the corners of the mouth; caused by deficiency of <strong>Vitamin B<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.988ex\" height=\"1.065ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -320.9 436.6 470.9\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(33,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></strong> (<strong>Riboflavin</strong>).  </p>\n<p>→ So, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.05ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"8.119ex\" height=\"1.645ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 3588.6 727\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D436\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D436\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1037.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"2192\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2192\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2315.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D43C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2819.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D449\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D449\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p></li>\n<li><p><strong>Xerophthalmia</strong> – dryness of the cornea and conjunctiva; caused by deficiency of <strong>Vitamin A</strong>.  </p>\n<p>→ So, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.673ex\" height=\"1.57ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 3391.6 694\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D437\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D437\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1105.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"2192\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2192\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2383.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D43C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2887.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D43C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43C\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p></li>\n</ol>\n<p>Hence, the correct matching is:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.439ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32.696ex\" height=\"2.059ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -716 14451.8 910\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D434\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D434\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(972.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1972.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D43C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2476.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D43C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2980.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D43C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3484.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\" transform=\"translate(3762.4,0)\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(4207.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D435\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D435\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(5188.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(6188.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D43C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(6692.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\" transform=\"translate(6970.6,0)\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(7415.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D436\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D436\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(8397.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(9397.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D43C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(9901.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D449\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D449\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(10670.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\" transform=\"translate(10948.7,0)\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(11393.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D437\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D437\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(12443.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(13443.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D43C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(13947.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D43C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43C\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is <strong>Option C</strong>.</p>"},"hi":{"direction":null,"comprehension":null,"content":"<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.452ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"46.154ex\" height=\"2.149ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 20400 950\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\"> सूची-I का मिलान सूची-II से करें। </text></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<table class=\"tg\"><thead>\n\n  <tr>\n\n    <th class=\"tg-c3ow\" colspan=\"2\">सूची-I<br>ऐमीनो अम्ल</th>\n\n    <th class=\"tg-c3ow\" colspan=\"2\">सूची-II<br>ऐमीनो अम्ल के पार्श्व श्रृंखला में उपस्थित क्रियात्मक समूह का धनात्मक अभिक्रिया/परीक्षण</th>\n\n  </tr></thead>\n\n<tbody>\n\n  <tr>\n\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">A.</td>\n\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">ग्लूटेमीन</td>\n\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">I.</td>\n\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">हिन्सबर्ग परीक्षण</td>\n\n  </tr>\n\n  <tr>\n\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">B.</td>\n\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">लाइसीन</td>\n\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">II.</td>\n\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">उदासीन <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.732ex\" height=\"1.97ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 2533.6 870.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"46\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-46\"></use><use data-c=\"65\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-65\" transform=\"translate(653,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\" transform=\"translate(1097,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"6C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6C\" transform=\"translate(1819,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2130,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> परीक्षण</td>\n\n  </tr>\n\n  <tr>\n\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">C.</td>\n\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">टाइरोसीन</td>\n\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">III.</td>\n\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">सेरिक अमोनियम नाइट्रेट परीक्षण</td>\n\n  </tr>\n\n  <tr>\n\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">D.</td>\n\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">सेरीन</td>\n\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">IV.</td>\n\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">हॉफमैन ब्रोमामाइड निम्नीकरण</td>\n\n  </tr>\n\n</tbody>\n\n</table>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.452ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"66.516ex\" height=\"2.149ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 29400 950\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/